            <div xml:id="m-420f2a95-ebd5-46e2-967d-5d6b2822c0b3">
              <lg xml:id="m-89b021fb-cccf-455c-9498-9f6d1ac69b60">
                <l xml:id="m-29bdb998-cc56-4029-9d9e-c314cd5a048a" facs="#m-a03bf584-7e40-4b95-ad38-d2aac19b7c63" label="ambiguous">604</l><l xml:id="m-074360e2-36fd-422d-af35-e3528bb39951" facs="#m-c9e1044f-ed93-4d70-a224-e3976c467235" label="text-like">Second Sunday of the Passion</l><l xml:id="m-1165b0fa-b8d9-484d-8b8e-6a8501dbed73" facs="#m-8b0b3758-3d8f-40b0-ae16-854552280f3e" label="text-like">AT SEXT</l><l xml:id="m-93ea22a0-f12a-454f-8961-71599712f3b6" facs="#m-e2ce76d8-d9e1-4653-9606-cd8a0408fb60" label="ambiguous">Ant.</l><l xml:id="m-070efd65-95f2-48a0-afd7-214a3966f269" facs="#m-3a1fc3f3-213a-471f-b8d7-64cd6b550766" label="ambiguous">4A</l><l xml:id="m-926d86f2-f06a-4785-be26-280a3c5f3105" facs="#m-1c2c9a85-4535-4c75-ab2e-f6d04bbe12c2" label="lyrics-like">Ibi reve-lávi“ cáusam mé-am, Dómine, de-fénsor</l><l xml:id="m-c76485d1-131b-418c-b9aa-acb2395eb8e9" facs="#m-253eee59-e290-4294-9f88-695f3f6fe306" label="lyrics-like">ví-tae mé-ae, Dómine Dé-us mé-us. Eu o u a e.</l><l xml:id="m-0d532696-151f-461b-a96b-83c5b148a9b1" facs="#m-9f593e3a-515a-439d-b561-24cc412991c2" label="ambiguous">Philipp. 28-9</l><l xml:id="m-8875fecd-8563-42ab-84dc-7246e2c49f62" facs="#m-3c39c802-8bcd-41d0-9f36-8a78bc686af3" label="ambiguous">Chapter</l><l xml:id="m-5c8300b6-b1c1-4693-b17e-aac61eb36e3f" facs="#m-a2fb6618-85d3-42ee-a539-ca436cfbdfff" label="lyrics-like">Umiliávit semetípsum factus! quod et Deus exaltávit illum,</l><l xml:id="m-9c5122e4-0e9d-42bf-9f1c-b46dd6c27629" facs="#m-1834dd59-158b-4cfa-8298-ed60a5e08a49" label="lyrics-like">It obédiens usque ad mortem, et donávit illi nomen, quod est</l><l xml:id="m-e5b29e0e-759f-4dd6-b2e2-c2d0f244367e" facs="#m-74a9dd5a-afd8-45c6-9cd1-806298c47fc5" label="ambiguous">mortem autem crucis. Propter! super omne nomen.</l><l xml:id="m-4b606cd9-ecc3-46ee-8a86-5ad7ef8a7069" facs="#m-0c93c5c2-b9af-469c-8d61-e5ad9d69e151" label="lyrics-like">Short Resp. De óre leónis. Y. Ne pérdas. p. 244.</l><l xml:id="m-3d2313ca-65d1-45eb-8fb1-abb2a9826445" facs="#m-11a43b4f-8e65-4ae7-b78f-318f8575e30f" label="text-like">AT NONE</l><l xml:id="m-3d9f651c-3ef8-487b-ad10-245e2f2b8260" facs="#m-ed8efc02-3d6f-4826-966e-ef5b42326c3e" label="ambiguous">Ant.</l><l xml:id="m-69bc1a5b-312e-4d3a-bcb2-882ae01fac0c" facs="#m-5729c487-95ca-434a-b325-d3296e2b2941" label="ambiguous">A</l><l xml:id="m-ac171207-90bb-417f-845c-acd212bd26df" facs="#m-c6611f0d-65bf-4565-9098-80f73a984a64" label="ambiguous">1</l><l xml:id="m-038427d4-d321-4c79-bd34-c524ae25d98f" facs="#m-f27e73e0-ed60-4cee-971e-c52747ddc326" label="lyrics-like">Nvocábo“ nómen tú-um Dómine: ne avértas fá¬</l><l xml:id="m-460e79c8-26c5-4d93-90c2-41d872051e29" facs="#m-37cb8d26-93d8-4306-89d4-79cad4e99716" label="lyrics-like">ci-em tú-am a clamó-re mé-o. Eu o u a e¬</l><l xml:id="m-00151d7e-e3af-4d96-94fc-03e77fa01150" facs="#m-5c022eda-1b57-4ba7-a19d-fc416555515c" label="ambiguous">Chapter</l><l xml:id="m-cce49ed4-a4d3-44da-b319-788aa6a8293f" facs="#m-39384db2-8b07-445c-87d2-e63384daf86f" label="ambiguous">Philipp. 2, 10-11</l><l xml:id="m-09adaf09-af12-42e0-b591-a31df1ef8fae" facs="#m-31f896f9-12e8-44e9-a6e5-a5f4aedb8d61" label="lyrics-like">TN nómine Jesu omne genu fle-[gua confiteátur, *quia Dóminus</l><l xml:id="m-8d3a4a22-a553-4a40-97f0-fc9c705d006d" facs="#m-6ad027d2-a462-40ca-bf82-23084424152d" label="lyrics-like">I ctátur caeléstium, terréstrium, [noster Jesus Christus in glória</l><l xml:id="m-b7a6eb55-f859-42f1-ab19-406cfe726e34" facs="#m-4ecebe75-fa9e-4a09-b2e0-cb96a23ebe37" label="lyrics-like">et infernórum: ! et omnis lin-lest Dei Pátris.</l><l xml:id="m-7d377c3f-a801-4fa3-8071-7f764d3f137b" facs="#m-89e9f1a7-707c-4a30-b04e-ce65a7c9e603" label="lyrics-like">Short Resp. Ne pérdas cum impiis. Y. Eripe me. p. 248.</l><l xml:id="m-156b1cf5-b695-48ea-8fe5-a48d87528451" facs="#m-89fe00b5-f58a-4507-8bac-704b0f736434" label="text-like">AT VESPERS</l><l xml:id="m-acabf7a6-91b5-4ab1-95a8-60abe74f51fb" facs="#m-87a4d4f2-0e65-4d94-a53b-dc19c064b86b" label="text-like">Antiphons and Psalms of Sunday, p. 251. (New psalter, p. 21*).</l><l xml:id="m-3726271c-f71e-49a7-9c2c-967390007f3c" facs="#m-de7da58e-7c56-48cd-937a-c8a364ce6b96" label="ambiguous">Chapter</l><l xml:id="m-67302f9f-04c8-4664-ba9e-2ed8060294ff" facs="#m-415f15fa-184a-43f7-a837-644bbc24a29e" label="ambiguous">Philipp.2, 5-7</l><l xml:id="m-ff52a9c9-13cb-4e87-b036-fabfe54aa62b" facs="#m-3aa11acc-0283-46cd-8367-650542bebaeb" label="lyrics-like">LVRatres: Hoc enim sentite in semetípsum exinanivit, formam</l><l xml:id="m-7901dadb-80de-4ecb-871e-8c5ed2910ebf" facs="#m-f77dddb3-f74f-457f-91ee-e160bd09ba79" label="ambiguous">Ivobis quod et in Christo</l><l xml:id="m-2629a11c-c6a3-4224-a787-060eda1c0ede" facs="#m-fc2767f5-fa5b-4f1c-becb-3fe4b7732702" label="lyrics-like">servi accípiens, in similitúdinem</l><l xml:id="m-65442fa7-4692-4fdb-b1aa-f95b838d2f42" facs="#m-cd4e7b34-e499-4718-821b-56f3ff48b36f" label="ambiguous">Jesu: qui cum in forma Dei</l><l xml:id="m-84cb5bab-8db3-403c-ae4d-237a1ba91abb" facs="#m-ed39aa9e-427f-4f66-a621-4410bb5fcf52" label="lyrics-like">hóminum factus, “ et hábitu</l><l xml:id="m-34899386-7880-4fca-8c89-7a24e64f8c6e" facs="#m-af8c3be9-f985-44a7-8c6d-f25f921908d7" label="lyrics-like">esset, non rapinam arbitrátus</l><l xml:id="m-a5d36aa0-8a62-42f1-bd06-5df877d42eaf" facs="#m-bd9ed4ca-56aa-4925-831d-9f94113bd88a" label="lyrics-like">invéntus ut homo.</l><l xml:id="m-4ce77cff-c69e-4d5f-a69d-130e8d1572a0" facs="#m-34fe81e4-0b81-4eb3-acd4-f103af9b1a32" label="lyrics-like">est esse se aequálem Deo:t sed</l><l xml:id="m-20b99674-150f-42fd-913d-fb8d9032c015" facs="#m-065bb557-2ab6-4785-b457-db9b3ab61477" label="lyrics-like">Hymn. Vexilla Régis. p. 575.</l></lg>
            </div>
          </section>
        </score>
      </mdiv>
    </body>
